{"id":9885,"artist":"Irving Berlin","title":"Always","lyrics_plain":"By Words and Music by Irving BerlinGenerated by NoteWorthy Composer\nEv'rything went wrong,\nAnd the whole day long,\nI'd feel so blue.\nFor the longest while\nI'd forget to smile,\nThen I met you.\nNow that my blue days have passed,\nNow that I've found you at last\nI'll be loving you, always.\nWith a love that's true, always.\nWhen the things you've planned\nNeed a helping hand\nI will understand,\nAlways, always.\nDays may not be fair, always,\nThat's when I'll be there, always.\nNot for just an hour,\nNot for just a day,\nNot for just a year,\nBut always.\nDreams will all come true,\nGrowing old with you,\nAnd time will fly.\nCaring each day more,\nThan the day before,\nTill spring rolls by.\nThen when the springtime has gone,\nThen will my love linger on.\nI'll be loving you, always.\nWith a love that's true, always.\nWhen the things you've planned\nNeed a helping hand\nI will understand,\nAlways, always.\nDays may not be fair, always,\nThat's when I'll be there, always.\nNot for just an hour,\nNot for just a day,\nNot for just a year,\nBut always.","lyrics_synced":"[00:00.00] By Words and Music by Irving BerlinGenerated by NoteWorthy Composer\n[00:10.00] Ev'rything went wrong,\n[00:12.50] And the whole day long,\n[00:14.79] I'd feel so blue.\n[00:20.00] For the longest while\n[00:22.50] I'd forget to smile,\n[00:24.79] Then I met you.\n[00:30.00] Now that my blue days have passed,\n[00:35.00] Now that I've found you at last\n[00:40.00] I'll be loving you, always.\n[00:45.00] With a love that's true, always.\n[00:50.00] When the things you've planned\n[00:52.50] Need a helping hand\n[00:55.00] I will understand,\n[00:57.50] Always, always.\n[00:60.00] Days may not be fair, always,\n[01:05.00] That's when I'll be there, always.\n[01:10.00] Not for just an hour,\n[01:12.50] Not for just a day,\n[01:15.00] Not for just a year,\n[01:17.08] But always.\n[01:20.00] Dreams will all come true,\n[01:22